+    *   Interactive Viewing: $O(1)$ per frame (constant time relative to volume size), dependent only on the number of key views and proxy geometry [G].
+*   **Memory Complexity:** $O(N_{views} \cdot N_{slices} \cdot W \cdot H)$, where $W, H$ are image dimensions. Scales with the number of pre-computed views and slices [G].
